le machines and click |cFFFFD700Into the Domicile|r and he will be on top of it.\n\n|cFFFFD700Dark Keeper Uggel|r is quite a close walk; go outside the vault room and turn right to the last room. He is near the entrance where all the golems are.\n\n|cFFFFD700Dark Keeper Vorfalk|r is located at the |cFFFFD700Grim Guzzler|r.  When you first enter the room after coming from the bridge, he will be located on your right side in the corner (in front of the band's playing spot).\n\n|cFFFFD700Dark Keeper Zimrel|r is located on the second floor of the |cFFFFD700Ring of Law|r.  When entering this floor from the |cFFFFD700East Garrison|r (room with the Shadowforge Lock), you will go around to your right and he will be sitting in the middle of the seats.",g={o(160845,{cost={{"i",11197,1}},sharedDescription="Was used to turn in Librams prior to Cataclysm, is now without any purpose.",g={i(11752,{b=1}),i(11751,{b=1}),i(11753,{b=1})}}),i(11197,{spellID=13564})}}),e(378,{npcID=9033,g={i(11464),s(4260,11816,{b=1,f=22,lvl=22}),s(4328,11932,{b=1,f=28,lvl=22}),s(4261,11817,{b=1,f=25,lvl=22,spellID=248278}),s(4464,12557,{awp=80100,b=1,f=7,lvl=22}),s(4262,11820,{b=1,f=6,lvl=22}),s(4263,11821,{b=1,f=5,lvl=22}),i(11810,{b=1,f=53,lvl=22,spellID=15594})}}),e(379,{npcID=8983,g={i(11268),i(11465),r(26914,{b=1,itemID=21956,learnedAt=300,requireSkill=755}),s(4265,11823,{b=1,f=5,lvl=22}),s(4264,11822,{b=1,f=4,lvl=22}),i(11669,{b=1,f=52,lvl=22,spellID=248200}),i(11819,{b=1,f=53,lvl=22,spellID=15604})}}),e(380,{description="Break the 3 Thunderbrew Lager Kegs to start the encounter.",npcID=9537,providers={{"o",164911}},g={i(11312),s(4318,11922,{b=1,f=20,lvl=22}),s(7222,18044,{b=1,f=23,lvl=22}),s(4230,11735,{b=1,f=5,lvl=22}),s(89414,151408,{awp=70300,b=1,f=7,lvl=22}),s(89413,151407,{awp=70300,b=1,f=6,lvl=22}),s(7221,18043,{b=1,f=5,lvl=22}),s(8767,22275,{b=1,f=5,lvl=22})}}),e(9543,{description="Speak to him to start the encounter.",npcID=9543,g={i(11313),r(15296,{itemID=11612,learnedAt=300,requireSkil