 of his endgame. The battle began when a mortal coalition of night elves, Alliance, and New Horde elements arrayed themselves before the World Tree to halt Archimonde's advance. Though they were unable to stand against the Legion indefinitely, they aimed to buy time for Malfurion Stormrage to prepare a proper defense.",mapID=329,savedInstanceID=534,g={h(-12,{ach(959,{maps=a[910],minReputation=a[999]})}),h(-31,{faction(990,{maps=a[910]})}),h(-45,{q(10947,{coords={{58,48.2,104}},lvl=30,minReputation={990,0},qgs={21700},sourceQuests={10946}}),q(10462,{altQuests={10460,10461,10463},lvl=30,maps=a[910],minReputation=a[998],qgs=a[328],sourceQuests={13432},g={i(29298,{b=1,f=52,minReputation=a[998]})}}),q(10460,{altQuests={10461,10462,10463},lvl=30,maps=a[910],minReputation=a[998],qgs=a[328],sourceQuests={13432},g={i(29294,{b=1,f=52,minReputation=a[998]})}}),q(10461,{altQuests={10460,10462,10463},lvl=30,maps=a[910],minReputation=a[998],qgs=a[328],sourceQuests={13432},g={i(29307,{b=1,f=52,minReputation=a[998]})}}),q(10463,{altQuests={10460,10461,10462},lvl=30,maps=a[910],minReputation=a[998],qgs=a[328],sourceQuests={13432},g={i(29302,{b=1,f=52,minReputation=a[998]})}}),q(10466,{altQuests={10464,10465,10467},lvl=30,maps=a[910],minReputation=a[1000],qgs=a[328],sourceQuests={10462},g={i(29299,{b=1,f=52,minReputation=a[1000]})}}),q(10467,{altQuests={10464,10465,10466},lvl=30,maps=a[910],minReputation=a[1000],qgs=a[328],sourceQuests={10460},g={i(29295,{b=1,f=52,minReputation=a[1000]})}}),q(10465,{altQuests={10464,10466,10467},lvl=30,maps=a[910],minReputation=a[1000],qgs=a[328],sourceQuests={10461},g={i(29306,{b=1,f=52,minReputation=a[1000]})}}),q(10464,{altQuests={10465,10466,10467},lvl=30,maps=a[910],minReputation=a[1000],qgs=a[328],sourceQuests={10463},g={i(29303,{b=1,f=52,minReputation=a[1000]})}}),q(10470,{altQuests={10468,10469,10471},lvl=30,maps=a[910],minReputation=a[997],qgs=a[328],sourceQuests={10466},g={i(29300,{b=1,f=52,minReputation=a[997]})}}),q(10471,{altQuests={1046