, to the north of the instance. It will be at the bottom of the pool.",sourceQuests={76290},g={i(206450,{b=1,questID=76291,type="ihqt",g={crit(60649,{achID=18616,id=1})}})}}),o(403703,{description="Pages 3 and 4 of Omarion's notes can be found in the first room of the Arachnid Quarter, hidden within the ruined structure by the slime pool.",sourceQuests={76290},g={i(206451,{b=1,questID=76292,type="ihqt",g={crit(60650,{achID=18616,id=2})}})}}),o(403704,{description="Pages 5 and 6 of Omarion's Notes can be found just before entering Faerlina's room - Instead of taking a left to enter the boss room, take a right. Page is hidden beneath some spider eggs.",sourceQuests={76290},g={i(206452,{b=1,questID=76293,type="ihqt",g={crit(60651,{achID=18616,id=3})}})}}),o(403705,{description="Pages 7 and 8 of Omarion's Notes can be found in Maexxna's Room. Once you enter the room, turn back to face the entrance and look up, there will be a grapple point just above the entrance. Grapple and walk around the outer ring to the eastern end of the room, where the notes will be waiting for you.",sourceQuests={76290,76307},g={i(206453,{b=1,questID=76294,type="ihqt",g={crit(60652,{achID=18616,id=4})}})}}),o(403706,{description="Pages 9 and 10 of Omarion's Notes can be found just before the tunnel that leads to Gluth. Before you enter the tunnel, by the pipe after Grobbulus, there will be a grapple point. Simply grapple to it to reach the note.",sourceQuests={76290,76307},g={i(206454,{b=1,questID=76295,type="ihqt",g={crit(60653,{achID=18616,id=5})}})}}),o(403707,{description="Pages 11 and 12 of Omarion's Notes can be found in Grobbulus's room. Climb the ramp behind the boss and turn back, you will see a grappling point to a small alcove near the ceiling of the room. Grapple there and walk to the end of the alcove to reach the note.",sourceQuests={76290,76307},g={i(206455,{b=1,questID=76296,type="ihqt",g={crit(60654,{achID=18616,id=6})}})}}),o(403708,{description="Pages 13 and 14 of Omarion's Notes can be found high on the ceiling on the corridor after Patchwerk. To reach the page, start by grabbing a grapple point by the tunnel leading to Gluth, at the broken portion to the left just before dropping to the boss, then follow a small grappling puzzle to get to the page.",sourceQuests={76290,76307},g={i(206456,{b=1,questID=76297,type="ihqt",g={crit(60655,{achID=18616,id=7})}})}}),o(403709,{description="Pages 15 and 16 of Omarion's Notes can be found in Thaddius's room, by grappling on your way to Zackett Skullsmash.",sourceQuests={76290,76307},g={i(206457,{b=1,questID=76298,type="ihqt",g={crit(60656,{achID=18616,id=8})}})}}),o(403710,{description="Pages 17 and 18 of Omarion's Notes can be found in the first room of the Plague Quarter, sitting by a meat wagon just to the left of the entrance. The page does blend in well with the wagon so it can be easy to miss.",sourceQuests={76290},g={i(206458,{b=1,questID=76299,type="ihqt",g={crit(60657,{achID=18616,id=9})}})}}),o(403711,{description="Pages 19 and 20 of Omarion's Notes can be found by the corridor between Noth and Heigan in the Plague Quarter. On the mob gauntlet on the left side, there will be a slime pool covered by a sewer lid, and some mushrooms in the area. The note will be on top of one of the mushrooms.",sourceQuests={76290},g={i(206459,{b=1,questID=76300,type="ihqt",g={crit(60658,{achID=18616,id=10})}})}}),o(403712,{description="Pages 21 and 22 of Omarion's Notes can be found in Loatheb's room, by a gate to the left of where the boss is standing (when looking from the boss's room entrance).",sourceQuests={76290},g={i(206460,{b=1,questID=76301,type="ihqt",g={crit(60659,{achID=18616,id=11})}})}}),o(403713,{description="Pages 23 and 24 of Omarion's Notes can be found by the platform overlooking Noth's room. The platform is accessible by reaching it via the Outer Ring.",sourceQuests={76290},g={i(206461,{b=1,questID=76302,type="ihqt",g={crit(60660,{achID=18616,id=12})}})}}),o(403714,{description="Pages 25 and 26 of Omarion's Notes can be found above the entrance to Gothik's room. Grapple to an upper alcove right at the entrance of the weapon mobs room after Razuvious, then carefully run along the small alcove all the way to Gothik's room to reach the page.",sourceQuests={76290,76307},g={i(206462,{b=1,questID=76303,type="ihqt",g={crit(60661,{achID=18616,id=13})}})}}),o(403715,{description="Pages 27 and 28 of Omarion's Notes can be found in the Four Horsemen room, by a sewer pipe to the left as you enter the room.",sourceQuests={76290},g={i(206463,{b=1,questID=76304,type="ihqt",g={crit(60662,{achID=18616,id=14})}})}}),o(403716,{description="Pages 29 and 30 of Omarion's Notes can be found by the stables in In Instructor Razuvious's room. Use the grapple point to an upper alcove by the nest just in front of the entrance of Razuvious's battle arena, then run along the alcove to reach the note.",sourceQuests={76290,76307},g={i(206464,{b=1,questID=76305,type="ihqt",g={crit(60663,{achID=18616,id=15})}})}}),o(403717,{description="Pages 31 and 32 of Omarion's Notes can be found in the room after Razuvious with all the enchanted weapons. By the right, next to the corner, by one of the window frames.",sourceQuests={76290},g={i(206465,{b=1,questID=76306,type="ihqt",g={crit(60664,{achID=18616,id=16})}})}}),o(403962,{description="Located by a cage in the first room of the Military Quarter.",g={i(206449,{b=1})}})}}),h(-58,{awp=100105,g={n(206572,{sourceQuests={76390},g={i(206573,{b=1,cost={{"i",206576,3}},description="Includes a wide range of Bind on Equip (BoE) Belts from Classic, including those found in dungeons. We specifically feature items where Dented Tokens serve as the exclusive or optimal source.",f=55,spellID=413881,g={i(206609)}}),i(206575,{b=1,cost={{"i",206576,3}},description="Includes a wide range of Bind on Equip (BoE) Boots from Classic, including those found in dungeons. We specifically feature items where Dented Tokens serve as the exclusive or optimal source."