ea. It is home to the Academy of Arcane Sciences, the only wizarding school in Eastern Kingdoms, as well as SI:7, a rogue intelligence organization.",g={h(-12,{ach(5476,{awp=40200,r=2,requireSkill=356,g={crit(17771,{achID=5851,id=3})}}),ach(5474,{awp=40200,r=2,requireSkill=185,g={crit(17745,{achID=5845,id=2})}}),crit(27727,{achID=6030,awp=40300,e=1,id=6,providers={{"s",103740}}}),crit(17787,{achID=5854,awp=40300,e=14,id=5,providers={{"s",100343}}}),crit(6640,{achID=603,awp=30002,pvp=1}),crit(27864,{achID=9924,awp=60100,id=43,providers={a[142]},r=2})}),flt(101,{awp=50004,pb=1,sym={{"select","speciesID",378,379,675}}}),h(-30,{exp(5390,{collectible=false,coords={{50.2,72.7,84}}}),exp(5148,{collectible=false,coords={{61.4,74.8,84}}})}),h(-31,{faction(72,{OnTooltip=_.OnTooltipDB.RuneclothTurnIns,providers={{"i",45574}},r=2,g={crit(5331,{achID=2764,awp=30200,id=2}),crit(5331,{achID=948,awp=30002,id=7})}}),faction(1353,{awp=50004,providers={{"i",83079}},r=2,g={crit(19481,{achID=6828,id=9})}})}),h(-32,{fp(2,{coords={{71,72.5,84}},crs={352},r=2})}),o(206111,{awp=40001,coords={a[486],a[630],a[840],a[833],a[628]},providers={a[128]},r=2,skipFill=1,sym={{"select","questID",28825,29391,29387,28573,28492,28579,39199,28673,28559,28709,28666,28490,27727,28531,39204,49561,28564,28552,28578,28543,28511,49564,39207,49551,49555,49556,49558,49559,28567,27726,29386,39197,49567,39202,28699,28708,26365,28563,28582,49550,49562,49553,28528,28550,28551,49566,28539,49554,28675,49565,28507,39188,28702,26542,28503,49560,28716,28558,28525,49557,27724,28576,28562,28565,28544,39181,49552,36498,40519,29156,49846,49863,49864,49865,49866}}}),h(-43,{awp=50004,pb=1,g={n(63596,{coords={a[873]},description="Provides the Alliance Battle Pet questline, the quests are given in the following order:\n\n1. The inital quests touring southern Eastern Kingdoms\n2. 'Battle Pet Tamers: Eastern Kingdoms' + 'Battle Pet Tamers: Kalimdor'\n3. 'Grand Master Lydia Accoste' + 'Grand Master Trixxy'\n4. 'Battle Pet Tamers: Ou