et to the bottom of the mystery, as well as the curse over the land.\n\nThe harsh lands of Drustvar are ruled by House Waycrest, who conquered these lands after vanquishing the ancient, evil Drust. The edifices of the Drust still stand in ruin across the land, but that's not all that remains of this accursed people. Recently, their evil leader has been awakened—and if left unchecked, his dark power will spread throughout all of Kul Tiras. Upon arriving in Drustvar, you will be met with a request to visit Mayor Cyril White of Fallhaven in eastern Drustvar.",petBattleLvl=25,lvl=20,g={h(-12,{ach(12941,{crit(71361,{achID=41207,awp=110007,id=1})}),ach(13083,{coords={{25,53.35,896},{22.64,54.18,896},{25.36,55.57,896},{24.73,59.22,896},{21.93,59.37,896},{22.98,49.57,896},{23.04,55.62,896},{20.43,55.32,896},{27.3,53.21,896},{26.1,54.56,896},{21.94,59.36,896},{21.17,57.45,896},{19.98,55.15,896},{19.97,54.62,896},{27.13,58.16,896},{18.83,56.81,896},{24.56,49.35,896},{25.78,50.19,896},{18.98,53.61,896},{19.19,54.19,896},{23.76,60.86,896},{19,58.29,896}},description="Collect and have active Witch's Boons: Excellence, Extra Pep, Rage, and Fortitude which are on a 5 minute timer and the debuff Witch's Curse: Newt. Debuffs can remove one of your buffs. Coords are possible brew spawn points."}),ach(13094,{crit(41794,{achID=13094,coords={{54.4,21.8,896}},id=1,providers={{"n",143929}}}),crit(42143,{achID=13094,coords={{55.8,44,896}},id=2,providers={{"n",129764}}}),crit(42144,{achID=13094,coords={{55.8,44,896}},id=2,providers={{"n",128361}}}),crit(41783,{achID=13094,coords={{58.8,34.6,896}},id=3,providers={{"n",124170}}}),crit(42265,{achID=13094,coords={{33,63,896}},id=4,providers={{"n",142278}}}),crit(42266,{achID=13094,coords={{33,63,896}},id=4,providers={{"n",135868}}}),crit(42267,{achID=13094,coords={{33,63,896}},id=4,providers={{"n",135869}}}),crit(41779,{achID=13094,coords={{24.6,65.6,896}},id=5,providers={{"n",132195}}}),crit(41780,{achID=13094,coords={{24.6,65.6,896}},id=5,pro