pillar.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48696,{achID=14339,id=43})}}),q(61294,{coords={{26.1,22.6,1533}},description="Behind some barrels of anima.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48697,{achID=14339,id=44})}}),q(61292,{coords={{30.6,23.7,1533}},description="The pathway to this shard starts at |cFFFFFFFF27.7, 19.2|r, in an area full of elite mobs.  Run up the ledge on the side of the mountain until you can jump down to the archway and pick up the shard.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48695,{achID=14339,id=42})}}),q(61291,{coords={{31,27.4,1533}},description="At the bottom of the lake, hidden inside the base of a fallen statue.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48694,{achID=14339,id=41})}}),q(61290,{coords={{33,37.6,1533}},description="Jump over the short wall to the left of the statue at |cFFFFFFFF33.2, 36.8|r.  The shard is at the end of the ledge.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48693,{achID=14339,id=40})}}),q(61257,{coords={{34.8,65.7,1533}},description="On a tiny outcropping behind Epistasia.  Jump from the side, rather than trying to fall backwards to the shard.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48668,{achID=14339,id=16})}}),q(61287,{coords={{37.1,24.6,1533}},description="The path to this shard starts at |cFFFFFFFF35.1, 23.2|r.  Just follow the ledge around the cliffs.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48690,{achID=14339,id=37})}}),q(61264,{coords={{38.5,53.2,1533}},description="Up at the top of a small fallen pillar.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48674,{achID=14339,id=21})}}),q(61225,{coords={{39,77,1533}},description="Underneath the bridge that runs from Aspirant's Crucible to the Vestibule of Eternity.\n\nUse a Goblin Glider at |cFFFFFFFF39.6, 74.6|r to reach the platform.  After you've collected the shard, leap off the side and a Kyrian will carry you to safety.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48652,{achID=14339,id=1})}}),q(61263,{coords={{40,59.1,1533}},description="On top of a pillar.  Jump down from the cliffs above.  Levitate helped me reach this one.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48673,{achID=14339,id=20})}}),q(61261,{coords={{41.4,46.6,1533}},description="Don't fully jump down from the cliffs.  It's on the lower portion, hidden on a narrow ledge.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48671,{achID=14339,id=19})}}),q(61286,{coords={{42.3,24,1533}},description="From |cFFFFFFFF43.8, 21.6|r, simply walk toward the shard's coordinates.  It's just through an arch on a ledge.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48689,{achID=14339,id=36})}}),q(61289,{coords={{42.7,39.4,1533}},description="On top of a gazebo with a crystal roof.  You will have to jump down to the shard from the cliffs above.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48692,{achID=14339,id=39})}}),q(61288,{coords={{42.8,33.2,1533}},description="At the end of a narrow ledge that starts at |cFFFFFFFF43.6, 33.8|r.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48691,{achID=14339,id=38})}}),q(61235,{coords={{43.6,76.2,1533}},description="On the middle level of the waterfall.  Jump down from above.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48654,{achID=14339,id=2})}}),q(61285,{coords={{44.9,28.4,1533}},description="On a ledge underneath a waterfall.  The path starts at |cFFFFFFFF45.6, 25.2|r.  Follow the ledge to the right until you get to the shard.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48688,{achID=14339,id=35})}}),q(61284,{coords={{46.7,18,1533}},description="The path starts around |cFFFFFFFF45.5, 20.3|r.  Just follow the ledge on the right.  You will pass a statue of a steward when you are about halfway to the shard.  The path is so narrow and short in some places that mounting will knock you off the path or prevent you from continuing along it.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48687,{achID=14339,id=34})}}),q(61253,{coords={{46.7,65.9,1533}},description="On top of a fallen wall.  Climb up, and then you can carefully fall backwards towards the shard.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48666,{achID=14339,id=14})}}),q(61260,{coords={{47,49.2,1533}},description="On the middle section of the cliffside, underneath the platform.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48670,{achID=14339,id=18})}}),q(61236,{coords={{48.4,72.7,1533}},description="On a very narrow piece of the framework of Aspirant's Rest.  Use a Goblin Glider.  You can go to the highest cliff on the other side of the building, but I was able to glide straight towards the shard from |cFFFFFFFF48.6, 70.7|r, land on the nearby pillar, and hop over to pick up the shard.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48655,{achID=14339,id=3})}}),q(61279,{coords={{48.5,34.9,1533}},description="On top of a pillar.  You will need to jump down from the cliffs above.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48682,{achID=14339,id=29})}}),q(61278,{coords={{49.9,38.2,1533}},description="On a rock underneath the bridge.  You will have to jump down from the cliffs on the western side.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48681,{achID=14339,id=28})}}),q(61254,{coords={{50.6,56.1,1533}},description="On a beam that goes across the top of a little hut.  You will have to jump down to the shard from the cliffs above.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48667,{achID=14339,id=15})}}),q(61258,{coords={{51.6,48,1533}},description="On the ledge of Hero's Rest, next to the stairs.  You have to jump down to the bottom of the rocky platform and walk along the edge to reach the shard.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48669,{achID=14339,id=17})}}),q(61277,{coords={{52.1,39.4,1533}},description="On top of a pillar.  You will have to jump down from the cliffs above.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48680,{achID=14339,id=27})}}),q(61283,{coords={{52.4,9.3,1533}},description="Enter Covinkles' Workshop at |cFFFFFFFF53.8, 9.6|r.  The shard is on the left side, behind some barrels.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48686,{achID=14339,id=33})}}),q(61237,{coords={{52.6,75.5,1533}},description="Underneath the cliff, on a small outcropping above the water.  You'll need to jump from the side of the hill to get to the shard.  Slow fall abilities are useful here.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48656,{achID=14339,id=4})}}),q(61238,{coords={{53.3,73.6,1533}},description="Underwater, beneath the little bridge.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48657,{achID=14339,id=5})}}),q(61239,{coords={{53.5,80.6,1533}},description="On top of one of the pillars.  Some strategic jumping is required to get to this one (and luck).",icon=3528288,g={crit(48658,{achID=14339,id=6})}}),q(61251,{coords={{54,59.6,1533}},description="At the bottom of waterfall on the left-hand side, inside a small shrine.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48665,{achID=14339,id=13})}}),q(61241,{coords={{55.9,86.6,1533}},description="On a little outcropping on the cliffside.  Some strategic falling is required to reach this shard.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48659,{achID=14339,id=7})}}),q(61281,{coords={{56.2,17.3,1533}},description="Underneath the highest part of the cliff.  Jump down to the second part of the cliff and walk underneath the large outcropping.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48684,{achID=14339,id=31})}}),q(61280,{coords={{56.7,28.8,1533}},description="Behind the Gilded Bulwark, on the left side of a small table.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48683,{achID=14339,id=30})}}),q(61247,{coords={{56.9,74.9,1533}},description="Partway up the wall.  You must jump down from the platform above.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48662,{achID=14339,id=10})}}),q(61275,{coords={{57.5,38.3,1533}},description="Enter the Hall of Beasts at |cFFFFFFFF55.6, 43.0|r.  The shard is all the way at the back, hidden behind some barrels.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48679,{achID=14339,id=26})}}),q(61270,{coords={{57.6,55.6,1533}},description="On top of the cliff (not in the cave below), at the base of a tree.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48675,{achID=14339,id=22})}}),q(61250,{coords={{58.1,63.9,1533}},description="Don't go up the small staircase.  To the right of the stairs, there is a passage that leads to the bottom of a little waterfall on the cliffside.  The shard is there, to the left, underneath a Vesper.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48664,{achID=14339,id=12})}}),q(61245,{coords={{58.1,80,1533}},description="You have to carefully jump down from the cliffs.  The shard is close to the edge of the map, next to a small pool of water at the top of a waterfall.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48661,{achID=14339,id=9})}}),q(61282,{coords={{59.8,13.9,1533}},description="On a ledge.  You will need to jump down from the cliffs above.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48685,{achID=14339,id=32})}}),q(61244,{coords={{61,85.6,1533}},description="On the edge of the cliffs.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48660,{achID=14339,id=8})}}),q(61271,{coords={{65.2,42.8,1533}},description="On the upper level, in a bookshelf.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48676,{achID=14339,id=23})}}),q(61249,{coords={{65.5,71.9,1533}},description="Use the Anima Gateway at |cFFFFFFFF63.5, 72.4|r.  You can only use the gateway if you aren't in combat, so be careful what you pull.\n\nAfter taking the gateway, head to the shard coordinates.  It is hidden behind a pillar.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48663,{achID=14339,id=11})}}),q(61274,{coords={{66.9,26.9,1533}},description="Underneath the edge of the platform.  Facing north, towards the sky, drop off the left-hand side of the platform and walk under it.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48678,{achID=14339,id=25})}}),q(61273,{coords={{72.4,40.2,1533}},description="Walk along the lower ledge that starts at |cFFFFFFFF71.4, 38.9|r.",icon=3528288,g={crit(48677,{achID=14339,id=24})}}),n(171732,{coords={{59.3,31.4,1533}},description="After you finish collecting all the shards from Bastion, Necrotic Wake, and Spires of Ascension, visit Hephaesius.  Give him the shards, and he will forge them into a mallet.",questID=61229,g={i(180858,{b=1,spellID=103261})}}),o(355435,{coords={{36.1,26.6,1533}},description="Once you have the mallet, take it to the Vesper of the Silver Wind and ring the bell.",providers={{"i",180858}},questID=61191,sourceQuests={61229}}),o(355449,{coords={{36.1,26.6,1533}},description="A Silverwind Larion will spawn behind you and drop a treasure chest containing the mount.",questID=61183,sourceQuests={61191},g={mnt(334433,{b=1,itemID=180772})}})}}),ach(14801,{crit(50341,{achID=14280,id=2})}),ach(14335,{minReputation=a[400]}),ach(14281,{crit(48209,{achID=14280,id=1})}),ach(14514,{pvp=1}),ach(14311,{crit(48579,{achID=14825,id=12})}),ach(14768,{crit(49947,{achID=14768,c